Package: frailtyHLnew
Type: Package
Title: Frailty Models via Hierarchical Likelihood
Version: 2.4.0
Date: 2026-11-23
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = c("Il", "Do"), family = "Ha", role = "aut"),
    person(given = "Maengseok", family = "Noh", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "msnoh@pknu.ac.kr"),
    person(given = "Jiwoong", family = "Kim", role = "aut"),
    person(given = "Youngjo", family = "Lee", role = "aut"))
Description: Implements hierarchical-likelihood estimation procedures for survival frailty models, including Cox proportional-hazards frailty models (Gamma, log-normal, and AR(1)), cause-specific and subhazard competing-risk frailty models, multilevel accelerated failure time (AFT) models, joint longitudinal-survival models, and penalized variable selection.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0), methods, Matrix, survival, cmprsk
License: GPL (>= 2)
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: C compiler with OpenMP support, BLAS, LAPACK
